What is in this directory, and what is not licensed here.

These files hold factual tables extracted from published documentation for the
units the archive measures: addresses, sizes, accepted ranges, initial values,
and the labels the tables give their own rows. They are kept so that what a
document states can be held against what a unit was measured to do.

The documents themselves are the work of their publishers and are not
distributed here. No document file is committed to this repository. Each
extracted table cites the printed page it was read from, so a reader holding
the document can check the extraction against it.

No licence is granted or claimed over any document or its contents. The
copyright in each document remains with its publisher, named in that document's
own record.

The structuring and selection performed in extracting these tables -- the
schema, the page ledger, and the machine-readable form -- are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.

This directory is deliberately outside `data/`. The dedication in `data/LICENSE`
covers the measurements in that directory, which are this project's own work and
nobody else's. Extending it over material read out of somebody else's document
would be a dedication this project has no standing to make.
